cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EdgeEngine AWARE in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "EdgeEngine AWARE: an application- and energy-aware simulation environment for reinforcement learning in energy-harvesting Edge IoT systems"
abstract: >-
  A Gymnasium environment in which an agent schedules the sensing and the
  transmissions of an energy-harvesting embedded node from hardware-measurable
  quantities only. Three application domains (smart agriculture with a solar
  panel, indoor air quality with an indoor photovoltaic cell, industrial motor
  monitoring with a thermoelectric generator) share one observation and action
  contract, and the node-side code has a C translation for deployment.
authors:
